# Frontend build-time config (Vite). All vars are OPTIONAL.
#
# Standard single-domain deployment (Caddy serves the SPA and proxies /api and
# /socket.io to the backend on the same origin): leave BOTH blank. The app uses
# relative URLs that work automatically. In local dev, vite.config.ts proxies
# these paths to http://localhost:3000, so no config is needed there either.
#
# Set these ONLY if the API lives on a different origin than the frontend:
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com/api
# VITE_SOCKET_URL=https://api.example.com
